1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,600
Brands spend real money on creator campaigns
and approve ideas on gut feeling.

2
00:00:04,600 --> 00:00:09,000
Nobody checks if culture
already made the video.

3
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:12,400
Preflight does. Here's a real brief:

4
00:00:12,400 --> 00:00:18,000
a luxury oud launch in Dubai, where a creator
reviews it and ranks it number one.

5
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:23,000
Preflight maps the idea into its
Creative Constellation:

6
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:25,000
hook, format, story, product.

7
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:27,600
Then Oriane searches real
Instagram and TikTok videos

8
00:00:27,600 --> 00:00:30,000
by what's said, seen and written.

9
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:32,500
The verdict: crowding 100.

10
00:00:32,500 --> 00:00:37,500
Across 160 real videos: 19 near-identical
and 73 close matches.

11
00:00:37,500 --> 00:00:42,000
And it's rising: similar videos
are up 113% in six weeks.

12
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:46,000
Globally late, but earlier
in Arabic and UAE content.

13
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:50,000
The insight: your look isn't the problem.
Your format is.

14
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:55,500
Here's the proof: a real review
with 127K views, 95% similar.

15
00:00:55,500 --> 00:01:01,000
Same format, same bottle close-up,
down to the exact line.

16
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:05,500
In the Creative Airspace,
every screen is a real video.

17
00:01:05,500 --> 00:01:09,500
Our idea is the star,
stuck in the densest cluster.

18
00:01:09,500 --> 00:01:14,000
Switch to Arabic-language content,
and crowding drops to 38.

19
00:01:14,000 --> 00:01:17,500
So Open Territory points the way:

20
00:01:17,500 --> 00:01:21,000
go Arabic-first.
38, versus 100 globally.

21
00:01:21,000 --> 00:01:25,000
Reroute rewrites the idea:
a street interview in a Dubai souk.

22
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:28,500
"What's the most lasting oud you know?"

23
00:01:28,500 --> 00:01:30,500
Same brand, new format.

24
00:01:30,500 --> 00:01:34,500
Both ideas are scored
on the same 314 videos:

25
00:01:34,500 --> 00:01:40,000
crowding falls from 100 to 75,
and from 92 to 24 in Arabic.

26
00:01:40,000 --> 00:01:44,500
And Replit turns the rerouted idea
into an animated concept preview,

27
00:01:44,500 --> 00:01:49,000
so the team can see what to shoot.

28
00:01:49,000 --> 00:01:53,000
Not a performance prediction.
Just less crowded in real data.

29
00:01:53,000 --> 00:01:56,000
Oriane sees. Preflight decides.

30
00:01:56,000 --> 00:02:00,000
Before you shoot,
check if culture got there first.
